Description: Windows 12-like desktop environment for Linux
 Win12 Desktop is the standalone desktop client for the Win12 Online
 web project. Built with Tauri, it embeds the web front end into a
 native window and provides system integration such as battery and
 network status reporting, GitHub release update checks, a local login
 password store, and ping / ping6 support for the built-in terminal.
 .
 It ships a Windows 12-style desktop experience including a start
 menu, window management, a file explorer, settings and a collection
 of built-in applications.
